.TH "HTMLTEXTAREAELEMENT.SELECTIONDIRECTION" "3JS" "October 28, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
HTMLTextAreaElement.selectionDirection \- HTMLTextAreaElement:
selectionDirection property
.SH SYNOPSIS
The \f[B]\f[CB]selectionDirection\f[B]\f[R] property of the
\f[CR]HTMLTextAreaElement\f[R] interface is a string that indicates the
direction in which the user is selecting the text.
.PP
For general information about this property, see
\f[CR]HTMLInputElement.selectionDirection\f[R].
.SH VALUE
A string: \f[CR]\(dqforward\(dq\f[R], \f[CR]\(dqbackward\(dq\f[R], or
\f[CR]\(dqnone\(dq\f[R].
